{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220550","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322055001:1":{"text":"……棺桶の中に住んでいるの？","source_cn":"……你们一家人就住在棺材里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2C05F043BB2B6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322055002:1":{"text":"一時的なものだよ。まだ定住場所が決まっていないのでね。","source_cn":"这只是临时居所，我们还没决定要在白山哪片地方定居。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x477BA61E3A22A5E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322055003:1":{"text":"シェミーラ、私の友人を紹介しよう……","source_cn":"哦，雪米拉，我给你介绍几位朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F334EEC62E6700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322055004:0":{"text":"あ、あなたたちは！どうしてここに！？","source_cn":"你……是你们，你们来做什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCA1DC567B372418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322055005:0":{"text":"まあまあ、落ち着いて。彼らは何もしやしないよ。座ってゆっくり話そうじゃないか。","source_cn":"吾爱，别激动，坐下来好好聊聊，他们不是什么坏人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF33D037F95AC0E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"